    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see a point to all this fighting. he’s already halfway there, and i’m just... i'm just lingering. it feels so unnatural to be the only one still tethered to a world that feels so hollow. sometimes i wonder if there's actually any peace to be found in this life, or if the only real peace is just... letting go. like, wouldn't it be more peaceful if we were both just at rest?",
